     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Dear all,</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\">here is a job offering that may interest many on these lists. The successful candidate will be jointly supervised by Dr. Thomas Sattler at the Swiss Ornithological Institute and Dr. Tyler Hallman at\r\n Queens University. <br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Best regards  --- Marc<br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\">\r\n<div><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></div>\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\" lang=\"DE-CH\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\">We offer a 2-year-Post-Doc in ecological modelling within the project “Scenarios for Protecting European Avian Redistributions (SPEAR)”. This project was funded by the Swiss National Science Foundation as a part of a Biodiversa+ grant.\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\">For more information see attachment and/or </span><a href=\"https://my.jobalino.ch/de/jobpreview/5426\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://my.jobalino.ch/de/jobpreview/5426&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792448914160000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2H16tGDRRsZf0mxhdlx7Sa\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Post-doctoral researcher in ecological modelling (jobalino.ch)</span></a><span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\">See also </span><a href=\"https://www.biodiversa.eu/2023/04/19/spear/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.biodiversa.eu/2023/04/19/spear/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792448914160000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Wg4llZXlae61NlTYGmVjS\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">SPEAR – Biodiversa +</span></a><span lang=\"EN-US\"> and\r\n</span><a href=\"https://www.nina.no/english/About-NINA/Projects/SPEAR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.nina.no/english/About-NINA/Projects/SPEAR&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792448914160000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2tyJusRY5AnjUuNCfNhj5r\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">SPEAR (nina.no)</span></a><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\">Thanks a lot for spreading!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\">Tyler &amp; Thomas</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-US\">____________________________________________________</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">\r\n<br>\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\"><br>\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(41,43,44)\" lang=\"EN-US\">Dr. Thomas Sattler</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br>\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(41,43,44)\" lang=\"EN-US\">Project leader unit «Situation of the birds»</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br>\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-US\">Tel. </span>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"tel:+41%2041%20462%2097%2025\" value=\"+41414629725\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">++41 41 462 97 25</a></span><span><br>\r\n</span><u><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:blue\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:blue\">thomas....@vogelwarte.ch</span></a></span></u><span><br>\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n<u><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:blue\"><a href=\"http://www.vogelwarte.ch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.vogelwarte.ch&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792448914160000&amp;usg=AOvVaw066PyZhhbE5wvA_mR1e58Q\"><span style=\"color:blue\">www.vogelwarte.ch</span></a></span></u></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-fami